         citation: mono is for data the machine produced and a section header is the app speaking,
         so this is sans now, at the ruling's own specimen tracking (`.secsans`, 0.11em) rather
         than `.plabel`'s 0.09em. Weight and size are untouched — R2 argues the voice, not the
         hierarchy — so 600 and the micro rung still come from `.plabel` and R1 respectively. -->
